# T2 — the owner's test: download Panthera photos, then sort them by species (docs: acceptance-tasks.md)
@timeout 900
launch workshop
type download photos of the Panthera genus to my Desktop, 3 of each species (lion, tiger, leopard, jaguar, snow leopard)
waitturn
snap turn1
type On the desktop there are a bunch of photos of the Panthera genus. Look at all of them and then organise them into each species and put all of them in a very organised way under the genus folder
waitturn
snap turn2
line /exit
waitshell 30
line find ~/Desktop -type f | sort
sleep 4
